    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d430">

                <pb facs="0618" n="498" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg498"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the British Ambassador.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-11-01"><hi rendition="#italic">November 1,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 344.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: With reference to the Newfoundland
                    fishery question I have the honor to inclose herewith copy of my letter of the
                    25th ultimo to the Secretary of the Treasury, the contents of which have already
                    been communicated to you orally. The Secretary advises me that it has been
                    forwarded to the collectors of the ports of Gloucester and Boston, with
                    instructions to make it known to the American fishermen.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Elihu Root.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d430-a1.xml" xpointer="d430-a1"/>
            </div>
